{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46763","headline":"山中寄凝密大师兄弟 · 齐己","name":"山中寄凝密大师兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一炉薪尽室空然，万象何妨在眼前。\n时有兴来还觅句，已无心去即安禅。\n山门影落秋风树，水国光凝夕照天。\n借问荀家兄弟内，八龙头角让谁先。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46763.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46763","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}